      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p>When the despot casts Charm, Diabolic Edict, Enthrall, or Floating Flame, either a target takes @Damage[1[fire]] damage per spell rank, or the despot gains a +2 status bonus to Deception checks for 1 round.</p>",
